-- in-place elimination through the LSP: one code action per variable
-- of the hole's context that HAS an elimination — including `h`,
-- whose type is a DEFINITION whose former shows only after exposure —
-- and a nested pair offers the fully-iterated split as well, with the
-- edit computed on RESOLVE, for the one picked, and stamped with the
-- document version it was computed against
def P : ℕ → 𝕌 ≔ λn. ℕ

def m : (n : ℕ) → (h : P n) → (x : (ℕ × ℕ) × ℕ) → (s : ℕ ⊎ ℕ) → P n ≔
  λn. λh. λx. λs. ?goal
